description: '''
Sprays either water, cryofluid or [#97CCE1]icedaggerium []liquid at much higher velocities, requires power to operate,
it can also use [#70AC30]darkheartium []liquid too, although it's not recommended to do that if said liquid leaks, and can only hold a quarter of the liquid.
'''
